{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04581","headline":"出湖寄赵冬曦 · 张说","name":"出湖寄赵冬曦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西泛平湖尽，参差入乱山。\n东瞻岳阳郡，汗漫太虚间。\n窘步同行乐，遒文互屡看。\n山戍上云桂，江亭临水关。\n川途倏忽间，风景依如昨。\n湘浦未赐环，荆门犹主诺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04581.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04581","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}